  "summary": "A foundational drawing technique using parallel lines and their intersections to create value and form.",
  "description": "Characterized by precise parallel lines (hatching) and intersecting lines at various angles (crosshatching), creating tonal depth through increasing line density. Developed as a method to achieve tonal variation in drawings before widespread use of washes and shading.",
